[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0010","text":"————啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0020","text":"杂志宣传用的照片，\n发到SNS上了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0030","text":"……！\n是之前那个泳池夜景的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0040","text":"哇……\n拍得好漂亮……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0050","text":"那时候好开心啊——\n拍了好多好多呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0060","text":"嗯……为了把全部拍进去\n试了好多角度……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0070","text":"星星太难拍清楚了\n滤镜也试了好多种呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0080","text":"呵呵……／诶嘿嘿！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0083","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0090","text":"选滤镜的时候灯织的表情，\n有种又酷又可爱的感觉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0100","text":"啊、那个是因为，想着构图什么的想着想着\n就变成那样了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
